  "_doc": "Upper-body styling rules per VN body cluster. Polarity ∈ {+1, 0, -1} for recommend/neutral/avoid. Cluster definitions: Trieu et al. 2024 (Vlákna a Textil 2024(1)) — 5-cluster k-means on 480 VN-female 3D scans. Polarity-rule methodology: Hidayati et al. ACM MM 2018, 'What Dress Fits Me Best?' (DOI 10.1145/3240508.3240546). Specific polarity values are this paper's derivation calibrated against the Trieu 2024 cluster descriptions, following the Hidayati 2018 encoding schema.",
